OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed at poultry
OL,4,Apremises
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk's first case of bird flu this
OL,7,Fautumn has been confirmed by the
OL,8,Fgovernment.
OL,10,FThe Animal and Plant Health Agency
OL,11,F(APHA) said highly pathogenic avian
OL,12,Finfluenza H5N1 had been discovered in
OL,13,Fcommercial poultry at premises near
OL,14,FDersingham.
OL,16,FA 1.86-mile (3km) protection zone and a
OL,17,F6.21-mile (10km) surveillance zone have
OL,18,Fbeen put in place around the site. All
OL,19,Fpoultry on the premises will be
OL,20,Fhumanely culled, APHA said.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
