OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed at poultry
OL,4,Apremises
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe restrictions mean all bird keepers
OL,7,Fmust follow stringent biosecurity
OL,8,Fmeasures in addition to the protection
OL,9,Fand surveillance measures.
